@name     data_concat
@alias    d>>d
@group    data
@c_name   skode_clause_data_concat
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  append current data array to previous, result becomes current
@doc
Concatenates the last two arrays: previous + current. The result is the current array.
Usage: (1 2) (3 4) d>>d
@code
    return skode_exec_d_concat(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
